cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cnnsim in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cnnsim: Chua–Yang cellular neural networks in PyTorch"
abstract: >-
  cnnsim simulates and trains Chua–Yang cellular neural networks in PyTorch: fast batched
  simulation on the GPU (torch.compile, CUDA graphs, fused Triton kernels) or CPU, a generalised
  model (odd k×k templates, output functions, fixed / zero-flux / periodic / closed-spiral
  boundaries, bias maps), template learning by backpropagation through the dynamics, and
  gradient-free baselines (simulated annealing, CMA-ES).
authors:
